    source:'https://visitcambodia.info/places/kep-butterfly-farm/',
    en:{name:'Kep Butterfly Farm',subtitle:'Butterflies and garden paths above the coast',type:'Small ecological garden',address:'Jasmine Valley Trail, Kep Village, Kep Province, Cambodia',intro:'A compact butterfly garden in the green Jasmine Valley area, away from the Crab Market waterfront. Visit for close observation of insects, plants and a slower countryside atmosphere.',history:'The site developed as a small garden attraction associated with Kep’s nature tourism; it should not be confused with the larger Kep National Park. Published descriptions and past photographs document a butterfly enclosure and garden setting.',manager:'This is a garden attraction managed by its own on-site operators, not a municipal park or a Crab Market facility. Opening arrangements and any admission fee are set locally; check directly before visiting.',architecture:'The garden uses lightweight structures, planted paths and butterfly enclosures rather than monumental historic architecture. Notice how shade, flowering plants and protected spaces support the visit.',visit:'Allow 45–90 minutes; butterflies may be more active in suitable weather.',hours:'Hours and operations may change; confirm the garden is open before travelling uphill.',price:'Ask the operator for the current entrance fee; no verified current tariff is published here.',transport:'Use the dedicated Kep Butterfly Farm map search and approach Jasmine Valley Trail by local vehicle; the last section may be uneven.',culture:'A small example of Kep’s nature-oriented visitor economy, contrasting with its fishing and colonial seaside heritage.',experience:'Observe butterflies without touching them and study the relationship between flowering plants and insects.',route:['Find the signed entrance along Jasmine Valley Trail.','Follow permitted garden paths and observe the enclosure calmly.','Return by the same approach, allowing time for the hillside road.'],photo:'Photograph butterflies in natural light without flash or handling; take a wider frame showing the actual garden.',tips:['Avoid disturbing butterflies or larvae.','Carry water and use shoes suitable for uneven access.','Check seasonal conditions and opening status.'],stay:'Accommodation in Kep town makes a short morning visit convenient.',review:'For recent visitor feedback, open the distinct Butterfly Farm Google Maps listing; this guide does not invent a rating.',faq:[['Is it inside Kep National Park?','It is a separate garden attraction in the Jasmine Valley area.'],['Can I visit at any hour?','Do not assume so; confirm opening arrangements with the operator.']]},
    zh:{name:'凯普蝴蝶园',subtitle:'山谷花园中的蝴蝶与自然观察',type:'小型生态花园',address:'Jasmine Valley Trail，Kep Village，柬埔寨凯普省',intro:'蝴蝶园位于凯普绿色的 Jasmine Valley 一带，与海滨螃蟹市场的体验截然不同，适合观察昆虫、花草与山谷环境。',history:'这里作为凯普自然旅游的一处小型花园景点发展，历史照片与旅游介绍记录了蝴蝶围网和种植花园；并非凯普国家公园的同义名称。',manager:'园区由现场经营者负责管理，而非市政公园或螃蟹市场的设施。开放安排、入园收费由经营方决定，出发前请现场核实。',architecture:'重点不是历史建筑，而是轻型围网结构、种植步道与遮荫空间，观察花草与蝴蝶栖息环境如何结合。',visit:'建议安排45–90分钟，蝴蝶活动受天气影响。',hours:'开放时间可能变化，请先确认当日是否开放。',price:'请向经营者查询当日票价，本站不提供未经核实的价格。',transport:'在 Google 地图单独搜索 Kep Butterfly Farm，沿 Jasmine Valley Trail 前往，末段道路可能不平。',culture:'体现凯普海鲜贸易与海滨旅游之外的自然教育和小型旅游经营。',experience:'观察蝴蝶与花朵的互动，不触摸昆虫或幼虫。',route:['沿 Jasmine Valley Trail 找到园区入口。','按开放的花园路径参观围网与花草。','原路返回，预留山路交通时间。'],photo:'尽量用自然光近拍蝴蝶，同时拍下可识别的真实园区环境。',tips:['不要触碰蝴蝶或蛹。','携带饮水，穿防滑鞋。','留意天气与开放状态。'],stay:'住在凯普市区便于上午短途游览。',review:'可通过蝴蝶园专属 Google 地图地点查看近期游客评价；本站不虚构评分。',faq:[['蝴蝶园属于凯普国家公园吗？','不是，两者为不同的游览地点。'],['随时可以进入吗？','不能假定，须先核实经营时间。']]},
    km:{name:'សួនមេអំបៅកែប',subtitle:'មេអំបៅ និងសួនបៃតងតាមជ្រលងភ្នំ',type:'សួនអេកូឡូស៊ីខ្នាតតូច',address:'Jasmine Valley Trail, ភូមិកែប ខេត្តកែប កម្ពុជា',intro:'សួនមេអំបៅស្ថិតក្នុងតំបន់ Jasmine Valley ដ៏បៃតង ខុសពីបរិយាកាសផ្សារក្តាមតាមមាត់សមុទ្រ។',history:'កន្លែងនេះត្រូវបានគេស្គាល់ថាជាសួនធម្មជាតិតូចមួយ មានរូបថតចាស់បង្ហាញរបងសំណាញ់មេអំបៅ និងរុក្ខជាតិ។ វាមិនមែនជាឧទ្យានជាតិកែបទាំងមូលទេ។',manager:'សួននេះដំណើរការដោយអ្នកគ្រប់គ្រងនៅទីតាំង មិនមែនជាឧទ្យានក្រុង ឬសេវារបស់ផ្សារក្តាមឡើយ។ សូមសួរម៉ោងបើក និងតម្លៃនៅទីតាំង។',architecture:'មើលផ្លូវសួន សំណង់សំណាញ់ និងរុក្ខជាតិដែលជួយដល់មេអំបៅ។',visit:'ប្រហែល ៤៥–៩០ នាទី អាស្រ័យលើអាកាសធាតុ។',hours:'សូមផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់ម៉ោងបើកមុនទៅ។',price:'សួរតម្លៃសំបុត្របច្ចុប្បន្នពីអ្នកគ្រប់គ្រង។',transport:'ស្វែងរក Kep Butterfly Farm ដោយផ្ទាល់ក្នុង Google Maps ហើយទៅតាមផ្លូវ Jasmine Valley។',culture:'បង្ហាញផ្នែកទេសចរណ៍ធម្មជាតិរបស់ខេត្តកែបក្រៅពីឆ្នេរ និងផ្សារត្រី។',experience:'មើលមេអំបៅ និងផ្កា ដោយមិនប៉ះពាល់ដល់សត្វ។',route:['រកច្រកចូលសួនតាម Jasmine Valley Trail។','ដើរតាមផ្លូវសួនដែលអនុញ្ញាត និងមើលមេអំបៅ។','ត្រឡប់តាមផ្លូវដើមដោយប្រយ័ត្ន។'],photo:'ប្រើពន្លឺធម្មជាតិ និងថតបរិយាកាសសួនពិត។',tips:['កុំចាប់មេអំបៅ។','យកទឹក និងស្បែកជើងសមស្រប។','ពិនិត្យអាកាសធាតុ និងម៉ោងបើក។'],stay:'ស្នាក់នៅក្រុងកែបងាយធ្វើដំណើរមកព្រឹក។',review:'អាចមើលមតិថ្មីៗលើទីតាំង Google Maps ដោយឡែក។',faq:[['សួននេះជាឧទ្យានជាតិកែបទេ?','ទេ ជាទីតាំងទស្សនាខុសគ្នា។'],['អាចចូលគ្រប់ពេលទេ?','សូមសួរម៉ោងបើកជាមុន។']]},
